{"id":"b225c0aad9789a30","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-ideal7-density-ideal.md","title":"ZFC Ideal7 Density Ideal","display":"df-zfc-ideal7-density-ideal — ZFC Ideal7 Density Ideal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ideal7-density-ideal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ideal7-density-ideal"],"display":"df-zfc-ideal7-density-ideal — ZFC Ideal7 Density Ideal","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-density]]","[[58-df-ideal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ideal7-density-ideal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ideal7-density-ideal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ideal7-density-ideal — ZFC Ideal7 Density Ideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8a5419e2086c0add\" href=\"?note=8a5419e2086c0add\" title=\"58-df-density\">58-df-density</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"58-df-ideal\">58-df-ideal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\">\\(\\mathcal I\\)</span> (ideal, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"58-df-ideal\">58-df-ideal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d(A)=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{|A\\cap(n+1)|}{n+1}\">\\(d(A)=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{|A\\cap(n+1)|}{n+1}\\)</span> (asymptotic density, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8a5419e2086c0add\" href=\"?note=8a5419e2086c0add\" title=\"58-df-density\">58-df-density</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}\\)</span> (set-ideal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"58-df-ideal\">58-df-ideal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7DensityIdeal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7DensityIdeal}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal7\\text{-}density\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7DensityIdeal}_S(\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(\\omega))\\land\\mathcal I=\\left\\{A\\subseteq\\omega:\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{|A\\cap(n+1)|}{n+1}=0\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal7\\text{-}density\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7DensityIdeal}_S(\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(\\omega))\\land\\mathcal I=\\left\\{A\\subseteq\\omega:\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{|A\\cap(n+1)|}{n+1}=0\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The displayed limit equality includes existence of the asymptotic density and selects exactly the density-zero ideal; indexing by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span> keeps every denominator nonzero.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-density","statu